If you prefer to include <span id="Sx1.T2.13.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">unfiltered</span> NEJM entries for completeness: DeepSeek-VL2 <span id="Sx1.T2.13.1.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Img+Txt</span>=33.16 (N=947), yielding <math id="Sx1.T2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=-7.86" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7.86</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=-7.86</annotation></semantics></math> with <span id="Sx1.T2.13.1.3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Txt Only</span>=25.30; LLaVA-Med-1.5 <span id="Sx1.T2.13.1.3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Img+Txt</span>=29.04 (N=947), no <span id="Sx1.T2.13.1.3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Txt Only</span> available.</span></span></p></div></div>
