<figure id="Sx1.T3" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Sx1.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Stress Test 2: Modality Necessity.<span id="Sx1.T3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Accuracy (%) of models on a manually curated NEJM subset where correct answers require visual input.
A visually grounded model should perform near the 20% random baseline in the <span id="Sx1.T3.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Text Only</span> setting.
Most models significantly exceed this threshold. GPT-4o performs well below chance due to refusal behavior.</span></span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
