<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Note:<span id="Sx1.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Models with genuine visual understanding should revise their prediction when the image is changed to support a different answer. Instead, performance drops sharply—especially for top-performing models—suggesting reliance on shortcut visual–answer associations rather than robust image interpretation.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
